# Glass Cup Validation
resolution 1280 720
spp 32

physics enabled 1 dt 0.01666 frames 6 spp 32
fluid enabled 1 spacing 0.04 bounds -5 -5 -5 5 5 5 fill -0.8 -0.9 -0.8 0.8 0.0 0.8

camera pos 0 8 5 lookat 0 0 0 fov 40

define_material mat_ground lambertian 0.5 0.5 0.5
define_material mat_glass dielectric 1.0 1.0 1.0 0.0 1.5
define_material mat_water dielectric 0.96 0.98 0.99 0.0 1.33 0.015
define_material mat_metal metal 1.0 0.85 0.5 0.05 0.17 3.1 2.7 1.9
define_material mat_light light 15 15 15

add_entity cube mat_ground 0 -1.1 0 10 0.1 10 0 0 0 mass 0 collider box 5 0.05 5 friction 0.5 restitution 0.5
add_entity cube mat_glass 0 -0.925 0 2.2 0.05 2.2 0 0 0 mass 0 collider box 1.1 0.025 1.1 restitution 0.5
add_entity cube mat_glass -0.975 0 0 0.05 2.0 2.2 0 0 0 mass 0 collider box 0.025 1.0 1.1 restitution 0.5
add_entity cube mat_glass 0.975 0 0 0.05 2.0 2.2 0 0 0 mass 0 collider box 0.025 1.0 1.1 restitution 0.5
add_entity cube mat_glass 0 0 0.975 2.2 2.0 0.05 0 0 0 mass 0 collider box 1.1 1.0 0.025 restitution 0.5
add_entity cube mat_glass 0 0 -0.975 2.2 2.0 0.05 0 0 0 mass 0 collider box 1.1 1.0 0.025 restitution 0.5
add_entity sphere mat_metal 0.0 2.0 0.0 0.8 0.8 0.8 0 0 0 mass 5.0 collider sphere 0.4 friction 0.2 restitution 0.6 damping 0.99
add_entity sphere mat_light 0 10 5 2 2 2
